---
description: Canonical API contract and Core Domain rules
alwaysApply: true
---
- contracts/openapi.yaml is the API source of truth (OpenAPI 3.0.x).
- Never create web/mobile DTOs independently; import @formazieleni/api-client.
- Every object endpoint must enforce object-level authorization (BOLA).
- Every business mutation must support Idempotency-Key.
- Every important state transition writes a domain event/outbox record.
- Files are private; use upload/download intents, never public predictable URLs.
- Do not build ETAP D business logic before Core Domain Gate C is green.
